      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUNNY DISPOSITION (3) didn't measure up in town at the latest outing but the form prior was good enough for a race of this calibre. Handles all going, draws the inside alley and gets some weight relief with the claim. Ticks a few boxes. EMPRESS ASPEN (2) saluted around this circuit last time out and will have derived a stack of confidence from that victory. Worth including in calculations. CIGAR MAN (1) is a bit hit or miss but is capable enough on his day. Respect from the Archibald camp. LORD PROTECTOR (6) returned to the winners' stall last start and looks ready for the step-up in trip now. In the mix. VEGA SICILIA (7) next best with the claim from the low draw.",
